    "description": "Guided Postman flow to test Saga checkout end-to-end through Kong Gateway.\n\nRun in order:\n1) Health checks\n2) Inventory success path (COD)\n3) Inventory failure path\n4) VNPAY success path\n5) VNPAY failure path\n\nNotes:\n- Default gateway URL is http://localhost:8080\n- Collection scripts auto-store orderId/orderNumber variables\n- VNPay callback secure hash is auto-generated in pre-request scripts\n",
